graph LR
    user[用户输入] --> master[Master Agent 主控仲裁]
    master --> symptom[Symptom Agent 症状分析]
    symptom -->|结构化症状舌象脉象| constitution[Constitution Agent 体质推理]
    constitution -->|RAG召回 CoT 置信度| plan[Plan Agent 方案生成]
    plan -->|图谱工具 实体锚定| result[最终方案]
    constitution -->|置信度低于阈值| clarify[澄清追问]
    clarify --> user
    plan --> grounding[Grounding 幻觉抑制]
    grounding --> result
